---
/** Slide 01 · Cover — Foundational Capabilities, Measured Improvements. */
---

<section data-slot="01" data-variant="aln-p1" class="deck-section deck-glow" style="justify-content: space-between;">
  <header class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6">
    <span class="deck-eyebrow">Reach × Lossless · Strategy Pitch</span>
    <span class="deck-eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Adult Literacy & Numeracy · Draft</span>
  </header>

  <div class="max-w-5xl">
    <p class="deck-eyebrow mb-5" style="color: var(--color-secondary);">What's next, with your gift</p>
    <h1 class="deck-h1">
      Foundational capabilities, <span class="deck-gradient">measured improvements.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="deck-lede mt-7">
      Foundational skills woven into the work, sized for the moments working
      adults actually have, measured continuously by audio AI — the first
      university where <strong style="color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 600;">literacy
      and numeracy</strong> improvements are real, visible, and compounding.
    </p>
  </div>

  <footer class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6">
    <div class="deck-accent-bar"></div>
    <span class="deck-eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">scroll · arrow keys</span>
  </footer>
